,"site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1633200787","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/9121#issuecomment-1633200787","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/9121","id":1633200787,"node_id":"IC_kwDODf6-U85hWKqT","user":{"login":"66OJ66","id":59021291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDIxMjkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59021291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66","html_url":"https://github.com/66OJ66","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-07-12T20:53:25Z","updated_at":"2023-07-12T20:53:25Z","body":"> edit2: It seems like https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/pull/8336 is when the crashing started.\r\n\r\nYeah, I checked the original PR where compressed texture support was added, and this comment mentioned an potential issue with WebGPU:  https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/pull/3884#issuecomment-1059886666","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1633200787/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"66OJ66","id":59021291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDIxMjkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59021291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66","html_url":"https://github.com/66OJ66","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1636051047","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/9121#issuecomment-1636051047","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/9121","id":1636051047,"node_id":"IC_kwDODf6-U85hhChn","user":{"login":"66OJ66","id":59021291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDIxMjkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59021291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66","html_url":"https://github.com/66OJ66","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-07-14T15:49:48Z","updated_at":"2023-07-14T15:49:48Z","body":"After investigating a bit more, this is caused by a combination of 2 issues:\r\n\r\n1) If the `RenderDevice` resource is missing when the `ImageTextureLoader` is initialised, it defaults to supporting all compressed textures (line 85)\r\nhttps://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/blob/05a35f6f484862fabd8225fcce2157d7e31c796c/crates/bevy_render/src/texture/image_texture_loader.rs#L80-L91\r\n\r\n2) The `RenderPlugin` and `ImagePlugin` are added sequentially, but in https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/pull/8336 the renderer initialisation was made async. As a result, now at the time of `ImagePlugin` initialisation the `RenderDevice` resource doesn't exist yet, triggering the fallback condition above\r\nhttps://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/blob/05a35f6f484862fabd8225fcce2157d7e31c796c/crates/bevy_internal/src/default_plugins.rs#L76-L82\r\n\r\nSo, fixing this should just be a case of delaying the `ImageTextureLoader` initalisation within `ImagePlugin` - I'll prepare a PR for this shortly","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1636051047/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"66OJ66","id":59021291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDIxMjkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59021291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66","html_url":"https://github.com/66OJ66","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/66OJ66/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.